Reading the Bus Pirate . . .
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE { 0x5E 0x3E { 0x5F r:2  }// read the imu 
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READ: BUS_PIRATE WASTE RS_MSB RS_LSB
SET: RESULT = [%RS_MSB%]
//SET: RESULT = [%RS_LSB%]
//
